72 GPU Vera Rubin Racks are live on Oracle Cloud at multi-gigawatt scale. This is AI Chips &amp; Data Centres, episode 37. After that cloud rack, a memory book that runs out of supply, a first Chinese high band with memory ramp, and a molecule that emits its own link. NVIDIA &amp; Oracle put Vera Rubin NVL72 and the Vera CPU on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure as of the 27th of October. The multi-gigawatt

