TIIK notes third quarter revenue of $46.7 billion, and a gross margin of 66.4 percent

00:07:32.843 --> 00:07:39.783
against 59.5 percent a year earlier. Advanced packaging was about 8 percent of 2025 revenue,

00:07:40.163 --> 00:07:46.403
and is expected a bit over 10 percent this year. CapEx of 60 to 64 billion dollars this year is

00:07:46.403 --> 00:07:50.763
