00:10:01.739 --> 00:10:07.699
Schneider Electric, Aviva, NScale, and Start Campus have piloted an immersive digital twin

00:10:07.699 --> 00:10:14.379
of NScale's AI infrastructure on the NVIDIA Omniverse DSX Blueprint, tying in E-TAP as well.

00:10:14.899 --> 00:10:20.399
TPG is reported to be looking at UK operator ARC at a possible $5 billion valuation,

00:10:20.919 --> 00:10:26.739
which is not a signed sale. Biggo Finance reports AI chip packages approaching four times the

00:10:26.739 --> 00:10:33.836
reticle limit, with that 2.5D contest described as running out to 2028. A spin you can address

00:10:33.836 --> 00:10:39.356
one molecule at a time, and that emits a photon at a set optical frequency, is the connector

00:10:39.356 --> 00:10:45.656
HPC wires account of NVision's nature paper treats as newly real. Until that interface existed,

00:10:45.916 --> 00:10:50.796
a molecular spin could be studied and still fail as a qubit, because it could not be controlled

00:10:50.796 --> 00:10:55.056
alone and coherently. The paper is described as the first individually

00:10:55.056 --> 00:10:58.056
addressable organic molecular spin photon interface.

00:10:58.656 --> 00:11:00.256
The molecule is a carbene.

00:11:00.816 --> 00:11:06.436
It is meant to go down as a thin film, the way OLED materials do, onto a photonic integrated

00:11:06.436 --> 00:11:10.296
circuit, including hyperlite's thin film lithium-niobate chiplets.

00:11:10.876 --> 00:11:15.696
Light, not a wire between neighboring dies, is what entangles that stationary spin with

00:11:15.696 --> 00:11:18.116
another spin on the same chip or another chip.

00:11:18.816 --> 00:11:22.216
A monolithic quantum part packs qubits until crosstalk.

00:11:22.216 --> 00:11:24.936
shock, control wiring, and heat fix the spacing.

00:11:25.456 --> 00:11:29.876
This photonics circuit uses the optical link so the qubits do not have to live in that

00:11:29.876 --> 00:11:30.616
tight neighborhood.

00:11:31.136 --> 00:11:36.176
The molecules run at two to four Kelvin, and they emit at optical frequencies the photonic

00:11:36.176 --> 00:11:39.216
chip can take without a separate wavelength translation step.

00:11:39.736 --> 00:11:40.816
Chemistry is the knob.

00:11:41.496 --> 00:11:45.756
Memory time, gate speed, and photon emission are tuned inside one molecule.

00:11:45.756 --> 00:11:52.036
The screen behind the car being evaluated more than 150 candidate molecules and 40 of

00:11:52.036 --> 00:11:53.576
them were synthesized in the lab.

00:11:54.076 --> 00:11:56.916
The loss budget is why the foundry claim is concrete.

00:11:57.256 --> 00:12:03.216
The platform is described as tolerating up to 70% photon loss and still running on standard

00:12:03.216 --> 00:12:08.556
silicon photonics, rather than an ultra low-loss plant most CMOS lines do not have.

00:12:09.216 --> 00:12:15.636
Throw away 7 photons in every 10, and if entanglement still closes on the 3 that arrive, the interconnect

00:12:15.636 --> 00:12:20.256
can be a photonic chip a foundry already builds, with lithium-niobate under a

00:12:20.256 --> 00:12:25.376
deposited molecular film. The path name beside that is decades and multi-billion

00:12:25.376 --> 00:12:30.756
dollar proprietary fabs for parts that only scale on a custom line. NVision's

00:12:30.756 --> 00:12:35.076
sketch puts first integrated prototype chips in the fourth quarter of 2026.

00:12:35.716 --> 00:12:40.776
Alive on-chip demo by the end of 2026, then a climb to 1000 physical

00:12:40.776 --> 00:12:47.636
cubits and toward 1000 logical, fault tolerant cubits on chip by 2030, in a data center form

00:12:47.636 --> 00:12:53.916
factor. Those are targets, not systems in Iraq. If a real link loses more than that 70%,

00:12:54.236 --> 00:12:59.356
standard silicon photonics stops being enough, and the design is back in the specialized low

00:12:59.356 --> 00:13:04.796
loss plant it was written to avoid. The same break hits if the thin film cannot keep the single

00:13:04.796 --> 00:13:10.216
molecule addressability the lab results showed, because an ensemble film is not a cubit array

00:13:10.216 --> 00:13:15.296
a foundry can tile, and if the workload needs two qubit gates that only exist when the

00:13:15.296 --> 00:13:20.156
spins share a neighborhood, the optical split that removes crosstalk also removes the

00:13:20.156 --> 00:13:22.556
interaction, and proximity wins again.

00:13:23.593 --> 00:13:31.093
On the horizon, CXMT's reported HBM3E mass production is time for the end of 2026, inside

00:13:31.093 --> 00:13:32.613
about two months of this report.

00:13:33.313 --> 00:13:39.893
Intel's 14A 1.0 process design kit is aimed at volume production early next year, while

00:13:39.893 --> 00:13:45.313
While the 0.9 kit for outside customers was targeted for October, and is not described

00:13:45.313 --> 00:13:50.353
as handed over, Core Weaves' new Middle East and Asia Pacific points of presence are

00:13:50.353 --> 00:13:53.753
set to start coming online in the 4th quarter of 2026.

00:13:54.453 --> 00:13:59.953
End Vision is targeting those first prototype chips in the 4th quarter of 2026 and a live

00:13:59.953 --> 00:14:06.193
on-chip demonstration by the end of the year, with a 2030 goal of 1000 logical qubits on chip.

00:14:06.193 --> 00:14:13.213
Before we go, watch whether SolidDim's commerce talks turn a $45 billion US flash plant from

